Just a reminder that if the nvram battery fails, the os_type will revert back
to default, whatever that may be on the AS200.  (On the 600au, it will come
up in the Alphabios console after the battery has died.)  Also, the default
boot for NT on most of the system boards is to directory \winnt.  If you wish
to boot 4.0, this will have to be changed in the Alphabios to \winnt40,
assuming
the default directory was chosen at install time.

