  I am not aware of support for a sound card in this series box...

  You could use a serial line -- terminal server modem control signals,
  local serial line signals, or otherwise -- to trigger a klaxon or other 
  external device.

  Dig up an (old) DTC01 DECtalk and have the system simply ask for help...
