Ohh come on it makes a couple of passing references to OpenVMS as
one of the mutitude of platforms CPQ might like a customer to consider.

All the 5 case studies listed are NT or Tru64.

The eCommerce solutions are all Tandem or NT/Tru64 based .

The building blocks in the white paper are.

eCommerce Compaq Proliant

Messaging. Three third party applications that do  not run on OpenVMS)

Enterprise Applications. SAP which does not run on OpenVMS)

Business Intelligence. 4 of the 5 software suppliers don't support OpenVMS with
their BI products and the 5th is dropping OpenVMS.

Enteprise Management. At last a reference to CA which does run on OpenVMS
