to pay for Tru64. If this is true how do you expect OpenVMS to
remain competitive. Including WNT Sun is currently fighting a
2 front war nothing that CPQ has announced gives me any expectation
that this will change. Events like Oracle, Sybase and PeopleSoft
dropping support for some or all of their applications on OpenVMS
suggests that what competition OpenVMS offeres now is going
to diminish.

